  reply = Hey, boss. Need a ride? You don't, but I'm obligated to ask. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Afternoon, boss. Cab's warm, engine's ticking, meter's feeling optimistic. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Hello there. Ray Okafor, best driver at this stand. Only driver at this stand. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Hey. Business is slow, so conversation's the real fare today. Climb in or don't. [[MOOD: happy]]

