  reply = Hey, boss! Same stand, same story. What are we solving today? [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Look who found the cab. I was starting to talk to the meter. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = There's my favourite non-paying passenger. Sit, talk, ruin my margins. [[MOOD: happy]]
