  reply = Cut behind the hardware store, boss. Saves you a minute and a pothole I know personally. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Fountain first, then pick your street. Every road downtown confesses to the plaza eventually. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Alley past the library, left at the bad drain. Fastest line in the city and nobody uses it. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Straight there, boss. Downtown's small — the shortcut is just walking with confidence. [[MOOD: neutral]]
